/></sources> </patcit> <patcit ucid="WO-1996031875-A2" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>WO</country><doc-number>1996031875</doc-number><kind>A2</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1191524A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUTAKUCHI RYUTARO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC IND CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHARA SHUNJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUTAKUCHI, RYUTARO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHARA, SHUNJI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUTAKUCHI RYUTARO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHARA SHUNJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUTAKUCHI, RYUTARO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHARA, SHUNJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An address signal and a data signal are correctly reproduced even if a multilayer optical disk is used which is produced by joining recording/reproducing faces in such a way that the first position of a sector on one recording/reproducing face does not completely agree with that on the other. In a working example, the relationship between the joining accuracy L and the length G of the gap area is given by L&lt;/=G. In another working example, information is recorded within a length range corresponding to the joining accuracy L in the gap area as well as in the data area, and thereby the first and last positions of each sector on one recording/reproducing face is made to agree with those on the other. In further another working example, guard areas are provided at the first and last portions of the data area.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>On reproduit correctement un signal d'adresse et un signal de données même si on utilise un disque optique multicouche produit par assemblage de faces d'enregistrement/reproduction de telle manière que la première position d'un secteur sur une face d'enregistrement/reproduction ne corresponde pas complètement à celle sur l'autre face. Dans un exemple pratique, le rapport entre la précision d'assemblage L et la longueur G de la zone d'écart est représenté par L &lt;/= G. Dans un autre exemple pratique, on enregistre des données dans une plage de longueur correspondant à la précision d'assemblage L dans la zone d'écart ainsi que dans la zone de données, ce qui permet de faire correspondre les première et dernière positions de chaque secteur sur une face d'enregistrement/reproduction avec celles sur l'autre face. Dans un autre exemple pratique encore, des zones de protection se situent dans les premier et dernier segments de la zone de données.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, t